<title>USA: HUSSEY COPPER PRICE DROPS TO 122 CENTS/LB AUG 8.</title>
<headline>HUSSEY COPPER PRICE DROPS TO 122 CENTS/LB AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was down two cents to 122.00 cents per lb. effective with shipments of Aug 8.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
